      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "TensorRT-Wan example I2V graph.\n\nWon't run yet: TensorRT Wan Loader needs a built model_dir (wan_model.json + 4 .engine files) via `trtwan build engine` - none exist until you write a --loader for your checkpoint and export/build (see docs/export.md, docs/engine_generation.md).\n\nKnown gaps vs a full workflow:\n- No negative-prompt input. CFG nulls the text embedding internally (engine/dit_engine.py _null_conditioning) instead of taking a separate negative CONDITIONING.\n- No Wan2.2 MoE (high/low expert switch) support - single DiTEngine only.\n- EmptyLatentImage is a 4D placeholder; TensorRT-Wan expects 5D (B,C,T,H,W) latents. Wire in whatever 5D empty-video-latent node your ComfyUI build has (e.g. WanImageToVideo, used for its LATENT output only) instead."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#321"
    },
